fy matched shard","Reopen rollout gate"],"order":9,"section_id":"evidence","section_title":"Evidence","showTitle":true,"textAlign":"left","title":"Incident response and release gate","type":"diagram","weight":1.5,"z":8},{"body":"INC-2026-0918-447 restored core traffic, but a long-tail retry storm left high-value customers degraded for 96 minutes.","composition_role":"report_headline","element":"Hero Title","engine":"TextEngine","groupId":null,"id":"c9","locked":false,"message_role":"Headline","order":0,"section_id":"opening","section_title":"Overview","showTitle":false,"text":"INC-2026-0918-447 restored core traffic, but a long-tail retry storm left high-value customers degraded for 96 minutes.","textAlign":"left","title":"Hero Title","type":"text","weight":1.1,"z":9},{"body":"Edge API · us-central-2 / shard 17 · incident window 2026-09-18 14:06–15:42 UTC · 31,884 requests failed or retried · incident commander: Platform Reliability.","composition_role":"context","element":"Body Narrative","engine":"TextEngine","groupId":null,"id":"c10","locked":false,"message_role":"Context","order":1,"section_id":"opening","section_title":"Overview","showTitle":false,"text":"Edge API · us-central-2 / shard 17 · incident window 2026-09-18 14:06–15:42 UTC · 31,884 requests failed or retried · incident commander: Platform Reliability.","textAlign":"left","title":"Body Narrative","type":"text","weight":1.1,"z":10},{"body":"P1 tickets decline from 42 to 15 and customer impact from 136 to 22 hours across six weekly checks after queue isolation. The decline tracks the mitigated period; it does not prove the retry governor alone caused recovery. The next deploy must retain per-tenant queue ceilings and compare the matched traffic cohort.","composition_role":"narrative_interpretation","element":"Body Narrative","engine":"TextEngine","groupId":null,"id":"c11","locked":false,"message_role":"Context","order":7,"section_id":"analysis","section_title":"Analysis","showTitle":false,"text":"P1 tickets decline from 42 to 15 and customer impact from 136 to 22 hours across six weekly checks after queue isolation. The decline tracks the mitigated period; it does not prove the retry governor alone caused recovery. The next deploy must retain per-tenant queue ceilings and compare the matched traffic cohort.","textAlign":"left","title":"Body Narrative","type":"text","weight":1.1,"z":11},{"body":"Next step: keep the retry governor at 0.82, publish the customer reconciliation, and reopen rollout only after the matched shard passes the 30-minute saturation probe.","composition_role":"conclusion","element":"Key Takeaway","engine":"TextEngine","groupId":null,"id":"c12","locked":false,"message_role":"Action","order":11,"section_id":"delivery","section_title":"Next steps","showTitle":false,"text":"Next step: keep the retry governor at 0.82, publish the customer reconciliation, and reopen rollout only after the matched shard passes the 30-minute saturation probe.","textAlign":"left","title":"Key Takeaway","type":"text","weight":1.1,"z":12}],"layoutPreset":"review","mode":"smart","nextId":13,"schema_version":1},"report_id":"report-75aaec8576c04250b2049860811adf56","revision":76,"title":"Edge API incident review · INC-2026-0918-447","updated_at":"2026-09-24T18:31:53.591303+00:00"}
